## 3. The three problems this plan exists to solve

**Name them on the page. A plan that does not carry all three has not understood the run.**

{{OUT_OF_ORDER_BLOCK}}

### 3.2 The requirements register must be extracted from a document that may not be touched

Slot 00 holds the customer's own documents. They are **never edited**, for any reason, and a
text extraction beside them is a derived file, not a replacement. `SDD-02` governs what comes
out of them.

Slot 01 is also one of the two measures the whole method rests on. `SDD-01` §3: *if the list
of things that must be covered is drawn up from the design itself, then measuring the design
against it will always show that the design is complete.* **A register written late, or
written from the design, is not a register.**

### 3.3 The two things nobody writes must be provably produced, not drawn

Slots 08 and 10 are produced from the slots above them. **Two pictures kept by hand guarantee
that one of them is wrong and that nothing says which.** Your plan says what produces each,
from what, and **what refuses if the produced thing and its source disagree.**

