## 5. Tiers

| Tier | What |
|---|---|
| **May change** | Only the files you create (§6), and the `README.md` of a slot **where this commission's or the scaffold's account of that slot is wrong** — with the correction reported, and a note that the fix belongs in `templates/spec/slots.yaml` upstream |
| **May propose** | Amendments to any standard, as an unsigned paper in `_amendments/`. Findings, numbered, with an owner. Questions for the owner |
| **May only record** | Everything else. Every defect in the carried material, in a standard, in the folder layout, or in this commission |

**A brief without tiers gets exceeded.**

